<title>UK: CRICKET-HAMPSHIRE CLOSE AT 71-2 IN SECOND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-HAMPSHIRE CLOSE AT 71-2 IN SECOND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHAMPTON, England 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hampshire were 71 for two wickets in their second innings at close of play on the second day of a three-day match against Australia on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Hampshire 156 and 71-2, Australia 465-8 declared (M.Waugh 173, M.Taylor 109).</p>
